0.7.7  F  mapFree      row  -> Unsafe: releasing a share is a raw-memory operation (MM-EXEC-9c)
0.7.7  F  internFree   row  -> Unsafe: releasing a share is a raw-memory operation (MM-EXEC-9c)
0.7.7  F  ffiCellFree  row  -> Unsafe: releasing a share is a raw-memory operation (MM-EXEC-9c)
